<ontology/ind_perfumery_cosmetics/#concept> a crm:E55_Type, skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Perfumery, Pomades & Essential Oils"@en ;
    skos:definition "Eau de Cologne, scented spirits, pomades, incense, and cosmetics — infusing alcohol, lard, and olive/almond oils with essential oils (bergamot, otto of roses, lavender, citronella, sandalwood), animal fixatives (musk, ambergris, castor), and fragrant resins/spices (benzoin, myrrh, olibanum, vanilla, cloves)."@en ;
