    rdfs:label "Evidence for Gum Arabic used in Calico Cloth & Calico Printing: Watt (1908), Commercial Products of India, scan p. 27"@en ;
    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "Stokes (speaking of Sind many years ago) says that it is inferior to gum arabic, but is used in medicine, calico-printing, and in paper-making."@en ;
