    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "A strong acid mordant cannot be easily thickened with starch; but it may be by roasted starch, vulgarly called British gum, and by gum arabic or senegal."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "essay_context" .

