    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "This preparation of ground madder is imported into Liverpool to the extent of from 500 to 600 tons annually from Marseilles, for the use of calico printers in the manufacturing districts."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .

