    a <ontology/EvidenceQuote/#resource> ;
    rdfs:label "Evidence for Argol used in Calico Cloth & Calico Printing: Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (2nd ed., 1840; Project Gutenberg #44562), s.v. BISMUTH"@en ;
