    rdfs:label "Evidence for Madder Munjeet used in Calico Cloth & Calico Printing: Watt (1908), Commercial Products of India, scan p. 939"@en ;
    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "Extraction of Dye. Manjit root obtained from this plant was formerly much employed by the Natives of India in dyeing coarse cotton fabrics into various shades of scarlet, coffee-brown or mauve."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .

