    skos:editorialNote "Review decision (prune): Role corrected from the quote itself: bichromate is the oxidiser/mordant of the chrome styles, not itself the dye; nitrate-of-lead quote removed."@en ;
    <ontology/assertsCommodity/#resource> <id/doc/doc_bichromate_of_potash/#concept> ;
