    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "Scheele’s green for the calico-printer is made as follows:-Take 1 gallon of water, in which dissolve with heat, 5 pounds of sulphate of copper, and 1 pound of verdigris."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .

