    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "As an oxidising agent, chlorate of potash is used by the calico printer for heightening the intensity of 'steam colours;' and in the laboratory it is in constant request."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .

