<ontology/use_chocolate_confectionery/use_chocolate_confectionery__1639__q1/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Products of the Vegetable Kingdom (1854; Project Gutenberg #15191), section ANISE" ;
