<ontology/use_chocolate_confectionery/use_chocolate_confectionery__1937__q2/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Products of the Vegetable Kingdom (1854; Project Gutenberg #15191), section CASSIA BARK" ;
