    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "The yellow glaze is made by mixing together in water, till it becomes as thick as cream, 112 lb. of white lead, 24 lb. of ground flint, and 6 lb. of ground flint glass."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .

