    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "After the sulphur and charcoal of the gunpowder had been quite acidified, I poured some solution of the baryta salt into the mixture, but no cloud of sulphate ensued."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .

