<ontology/use_hats_brushes_upholstery/use_hats_brushes_upholstery__0188__q1/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (2nd ed., 1840; Project Gutenberg #44562), s.v. HAT MANUFACTURE" ;
