    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "Under the heads of Cork, Quercitron, and Valonia, other products of oak will be found noticed. OAK-BARK, the bark of the oak which is largely used for tanning; the inner cortical of young trees being preferred, as containing a larger proportion of tannin."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .

