<ontology/use_leather_tanning/use_leather_tanning__doc_mimosa_bark__q1/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Products of the Vegetable Kingdom (1854; Project Gutenberg #15191), section MIMOSA BARK" ;
