<ontology/use_paper_making/use_paper_making__0066__q1/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Watt (1908), Commercial Products of India, scan p. 875" ;
    dcterms:source <https://archive.org/details/b31361584/page/n875/mode/1up> ;
    a <ontology/EvidenceQuote/#resource> ;
    rdfs:label "Evidence for Rags used in Paper Making & Cardboard: Watt (1908), Commercial Products of India, scan p. 875"@en ;
    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "So also Gibbon mentions that the knowledge of paper-making from linen rags was diffused from Samarkand, and Cassire is of opinion that it reached Mecca in the year 710 A.D."@en ;
