<ontology/use_perfumery_cosmetics/use_perfumery_cosmetics__0445__q1/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (2nd ed., 1840; Project Gutenberg #44562), s.v. PERFUMERY, ART OF" ;
