    rdfs:label "Evidence for Musk used in Perfumery, Pomades & Essential Oils: Watt (1908), Commercial Products of India, scan p. 641"@en ;
    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "The seeds afford an odorous principle employed in perfumery as a substitute for musk."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .

