    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "The following may serve as an example:-Pommade à la vanille, commonly called Roman. 12 pounds of pommade à la rose. 3 -- oil à la rose. 1 -- vanilla, first quality, pulverized. 6 ounces bergamote."@en ;
