    rdfs:label "Evidence for Gum Arabic used in Pharmaceuticals & Druggists' Preparations: Watt (1908), Commercial Products of India, scan p. 28"@en ;
    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "This gum is most frequently used for medicinal purposes, and may, in fact, be regarded as the true officinal Gum Arabic of England, India and America."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .

