<ontology/use_pharmaceuticals/use_pharmaceuticals__0400__q2/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Products of the Vegetable Kingdom (1854; Project Gutenberg #15191), section GAMBOGE" ;
