<ontology/use_pharmaceuticals/use_pharmaceuticals__0573__q1/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (2nd ed., 1840; Project Gutenberg #44562), s.v. OILS" ;
