<ontology/use_pharmaceuticals/use_pharmaceuticals__doc_morphia__q3/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Products of the Vegetable Kingdom (1854; Project Gutenberg #15191), section THE POPPY" ;
