    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "Gutta-percha is chiefly obtained from trees that belong to the SAPOTACEÆ, while caoutchouc is derived from certain plants which have been placed in three widely different natural orders."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .

<ontology/use_rubber_waterproofing/use_rubber_waterproofing__0015__q3/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Simmonds (1892), Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products, scan p. 46" ;
