    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "That stearine is very difficult of saponification. Mustard-seed oil. The white or yellow seed affords 36 per cent. of oil, and the black seed 18 per cent."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .

