    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "The varnish ought always to be made harder in summer than in winter, and it will become so if it be suffered to boil longer, or if a greater proportion of the asphaltum or brown rosin be used."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .

