    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "The copper plates, if new, are now prepared, by rubbing them over with a linen cloth dipt in a solution of verdigris; and they are laid up alongside of one another to"@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "essay_context" .

