<ontology/use_woollen_silk_dyeing/use_woollen_silk_dyeing__0136__q1/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Thomas Mortimer (rev. Dickinson), A General Commercial Dictionary (1823), scan p. 788" ;
