<ontology/use_woollen_silk_dyeing/use_woollen_silk_dyeing__1899__q1/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (2nd ed., 1840; Project Gutenberg #44562), s.v. FEATHERS" ;
